# Trained models, except the shipped one. A checkpoint is generated output and
# does not belong in git as a rule - but a branch that cannot be cloned and run
# is worth less than the rule is worth keeping, and 11 MB is a price worth
# paying for that. Models a retrain produces stay out.
models/*
!models/card.pt
